# Defensive: never commit anything that looks like an SSH/PGP key, even if a
# typo creates a file named like a shell command (we have had `ssh-keygen
# "git push origin main"` accidents before — see /root/.cursor-quarantine/).
*.pem
*.key
*id_ed25519*
*id_rsa*
*BEGIN_OPENSSH_PRIVATE_KEY*
